{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1506125-hunting-target","id":1506125,"title":"Hunting Target","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-03-22T00:43:50-07:00","id":1506125,"title":"Hunting Target","content":"I thought of this strange scenario. A group of hunters, is looking at the newspapers and materials on the internet and comes across an area that is famous for disappearances and suspicious deaths of animals, for an ordinary person this is nothing, but they find it suspicious and go to investigate, since that the place is half a day's drive from their area, but little do they know that in the region there is a family of man-eaters (werewolves that eat people) among the local farmers. Like I said weird, but maybe it would make a good story.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-22T03:37:45-07:00","id":1506131,"title":"","content":"The only odd thing I would really find out of place in a WtA game, is that given how utterly despised Man-Eaters are by the rest of the Garou, the idea that no kinfolk, spirit, or Garou hasn't already found out about this and lead the effort to clean it up seems off if it's bad enough mortal hunters have figured it out. It can of course, be an interesting story if Garou and mortal hunters are after the same prey, but realistically if you're coming at this from a Garou PC perspective mortal hunters (unless they have access to significant Numina) aren't that big of a problem in this scenario because any packs sent in to deal with the Man-Eaters that have gotten themselves noticed by local media is going to have some socially gifted (and Gifted) individuals ready to help cover things up.<br /> <br /> If you're thinking about how this would play out for mortal hunter PCs, or the Imbued, you might want to broach the subject in a different forum to limit the assumptions posting it here brings with it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}